      "content": "thanks. i just gotta check one thing though—i'm seeing a report in my inbox that about 5,000 customer names and emails might have been exposed during the glitch. if that's true, saying \"no sensitive info was compromised\" is going to look pretty bad if it comes out later. are you sure we should be that definitive in the statement?",
